sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Handler as PlanRemoteItemsHandler
    participant Service as RemotePlanner
    participant Adapter as TodoApi
    participant Client as HttpClient
    participant API as Todo API, or its emulator with TODO_API_HOST=mock

    Handler->>+Service: plan(titles)
    Service->>+Adapter: plan_items(titles)
    Adapter->>+Client: call(POST, path, request, decode)
    Note over Client: the operation is in the adapter's list, the client middleware run around each attempt
    Note over Client: record "http client request sent"
    Client->>+API: POST /v1/items/plan, JSON, X-Request-Id, within TODO_API_TIMEOUT
    API-->>-Client: answer, or none
    Note over Client: record "http client response received"
    Client-->>-Adapter: the decoded answer, or raises ApiUnavailableError or ApiStatusError
    Adapter-->>-Service: list of todo_api.Item, or the error
    Note over Service: ApiUnavailableError: kind unavailable. Code INVALID_ARGUMENT: kind invalid. Anything else: no kind
    Service-->>-Handler: list of entity.Item, or an error
